---
const { data } = Astro.locals.starlightRoute.entry;
const showBio =
  data.articleType !== 'page' &&
  data.authors?.some(({ name }) => name === 'Ben');
---

{showBio && (
  <section
    class="hl-author-bio"
    aria-labelledby="author-bio-heading"
    data-pagefind-ignore
  >
    <h2 id="author-bio-heading">About Ben</h2>
    <p>
      I’m a software engineer, AI enthusiast, homelab tinkerer and passionate
      gourmet cook. I love pushing boundaries, challenging conventional thinking
      and finding simple, practical solutions to complex technical problems. I’m
      a big believer in starting with an MVP, proving what works and building
      from there.
    </p>
    <p>
      Away from the keyboard, you’ll find me experimenting with gourmet cooking,
      enjoying a good coffee, a great Shiraz or a pint of Guinness. Whether it’s
      technology or food, I’m always keen to try something new.
    </p>
  </section>
)}

<style>
  .hl-author-bio {
    margin-block-start: 2rem;
    padding: clamp(1rem, 4vw, 1.5rem);
    border: 1px solid var(--hl-rule-soft);
    border-radius: 0.25rem;
    background: var(--hl-callout);
    color: var(--hl-ink);
  }
  h2 {
    margin: 0 0 0.75rem;
    font: 700 1.25rem/1.25 var(--sl-font);
  }
  p {
    margin: 0;
    font: 1.125rem/1.7 var(--hl-reading);
  }
  p + p {
    margin-block-start: 0.75rem;
  }
</style>
